BT /F1 11 Tf 50 750 Td 14 TL (SAMPLE NOTES - NOT AN OFFICIAL DOCUMENT. Registration. A business that supplies only goods must) ' (take GST registration when its aggregate turnover in a financial year exceeds Rs 40 lakh. For) ' (businesses supplying services the limit is Rs 20 lakh. Lower limits apply in some special) ' (category states. Inter-state supply of goods generally needs registration regardless of) ' (turnover, with limited exceptions.) ' ET
endstream
