BT /F1 11 Tf 50 750 Td 14 TL (Composition scheme. A small taxpayer whose aggregate turnover is up to Rs 1.5 crore can opt for) ' (the composition scheme and pay tax at a fixed percentage of turnover instead of the normal) ' (rates. Traders and manufacturers pay 1 percent of turnover. A composition dealer cannot claim) ' (input tax credit, cannot collect tax from customers, issues a bill of supply instead of a tax) ' (invoice, and cannot make inter-state outward supplies.) ' ET
endstream
endobj
