BT /F1 11 Tf 50 750 Td 14 TL (Returns. Regular taxpayers file GSTR-1 \(details of outward supplies\) by the 11th of the) ' (following month and GSTR-3B \(summary return and payment of tax\) by the 20th of the following) ' (month. Taxpayers under the QRMP scheme, with turnover up to Rs 5 crore, can file returns) ' (quarterly and pay tax monthly.) ' ET
endstream
